Z||000017||stimpy||06-19-2001||09:37 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by mblackwell:<BR><B>Here are my stupid questions of the day, What are "dubs"?<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>dubs(n)-<I>duhbz</I> also dubz. slang colloquialism. Pertaining to the number 20, as in "rolling on dubz"=20" rims, "peeling off a dub" to remove a twenty dollar bill from one's money roll.  May also be referred to as a twump, especially when referring to $20 bags of street drugs. <p>[This message has been edited by stimpy (edited 06-19-2001).]||||reg||1
