Z||000020||p4n1c||06-19-2001||10:11 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 84Bill:<BR><B>And I thaught a Dub was something you roll up and smoke   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>That's a doob.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  A dub is a double.  In english, "I got a twenty dollar bill out of my wallet for this guy.".  Translated, "Iz done peel off a dub for dis sucka."||||reg||10
